# ASHFALL PROJECT RULES (Cursor)

- Game Engine: Godot Engine 4.7+ (.NET / C# Edition).
- Never invoke or run Unity. All execution and testing must be performed with Godot (`godot --path .` / `dotnet build Ashfall.csproj`).
- C# scripts are located in `src/` and `scripts/`.
- Entry scene: `scenes/Main.tscn`.
- Project configuration: `project.godot`.
